5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Hello everyone. Since we are reorganizing, I believe we should be very careful about the data we use to decide the new layout.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I agree. I want to make sure the new spots are comfortable for everyone.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this quick and efficient! I don't want us spending forever on this. What should we look into first?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"We need to be honest about the trade-offs. Some spots are inevitably better than others, and we should acknowledge that now.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it's important to consider who we sit next to. It affects how we work together.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,I want to check the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I'll take the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the arrival times in the badge records.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll examine the drawn plan against the staff survey and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look at the two project strands within earshot last spring and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
